  "goodToKnow": "Das Rohr is a pipe or tube: das Wasserrohr, ein Rohrbruch (burst pipe). It's also reed: das Schilfrohr, and der Rohrstock was the cane once used in schools. Related is die Röhre: a tube, a valve, and colloquially the oven; in die Röhre gucken means to be left empty-handed. Voll aus allen Rohren means with all guns blazing. Plural: die Rohre."
